  "content": "<img style=\"float:left\" src=\"\"><div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/26.1-积极开发-海绿\" alt=\"静态徽章\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.21.11-修复bug-道奇蓝\" alt=\"静态徽章\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.21.1-修复bug-道奇蓝\" alt=\"静态徽章\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/US/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"美国国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/CN/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"中国国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/RU/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"俄罗斯国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/TR/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"土耳其国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/CL/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"智利国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/BR/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"巴西国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/ES/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"西班牙国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/UA/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"乌克兰国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/DE/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"德国国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/AR/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"阿根廷国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/VN/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"越南国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/KR/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"韩国国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/PL/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"波兰国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/RO/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"罗马尼亚国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/SE/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"瑞典国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/JP/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"日本国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/IT/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"意大利国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/NL/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"荷兰国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/FR/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"法国国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/HU/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"匈牙利国旗\">\n<img src=\"https://flagsapi.com/BY/shiny/24.png\" alt=\"白俄罗斯国旗\"></div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d502599025f03b1d821284de4ddbbf8d230d0c2.webp\" alt=\"基础武器横幅\"><span>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkhazoda.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6d32f79d6730fcfa7eb1c59b0c71783f3429990.png\" alt=\"探索所有模组按钮\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpoeditor.com%252fjoin%252fproject%252fvW0G3i42PX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/26ca581bda9315561258983f084c33103c7610bf.png\" alt=\"帮助翻译按钮\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.khazoda.com%252fbasicweapons%252fmaterialpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c38b8f135ec8ecfd389d9ddb2b46ca6acd59a84.png\" alt=\"材质包按钮\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.khazoda.com%252fbasicweapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bdc40049d20ff26aa3f65f03d2e758a352d1bce.png\" alt=\"完整模组描述按钮\"></a>\n</span><div><a href=\"https://github.com/khazoda-mods/basicweapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d8f646edd7d2c78e4e4ac342bd23e39bffec110a.png\" alt=\"GitHub仓库按钮\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/khazoda/basicweapons-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ca03d06a7f0a55598d86ab0aa51bddcdac798443.png\" alt=\"GitHub仓库按钮\"></a></div><h1>关于</h1><strong>基础武器模组为Minecraft的每一种原版工具材料添加了六种原版风格的武器类型，扩展了其近战武器系统。</strong><ul>\n<li>新增匕首、棍棒、锤子、长矛、法杖和长柄刀</li>\n<li>每种武器围绕伤害、速度、攻击距离、合成成本和效果进行平衡</li>\n<li>安装定制<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.khazoda.com%252fbasicweapons%252fmaterialpacks%252fhelp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">材质包</a>以添加来自其他模组材料的武器</li>\n<li>包含内置的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbronze\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">青铜</a>模组兼容</li>\n</ul><hr><strong>⚠️ 影响本模组的Minecraft漏洞</strong><ul>\n<li>❌ <strong>问题</strong>：Minecraft 1.21.10及以下版本存在一个漏洞，导致原版Minecraft中的物品模型出现可见间隙。</li>\n<li>🟢 <strong>解决方案</strong>：<ul>\n<li>1.21.10及更早：强烈推荐使用<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodelfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模型间隙修复</a></strong>模组</li>\n<li>1.21.11+：Mojang已在1.21.11版本中修复此漏洞（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC%252fissues%252fMC-73186\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-73186</a>）</li></ul></li>\n<li>❌ <strong>问题</strong>：\nMinecraft 1.21+存在一个漏洞（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC%252fissues%252fMC-271840\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-271840</a>），导致\n伤害增加附魔（如锋利和威能）无法在武器提示中显示伤害加成。</li>\n<li>🟢 <strong>解决方案</strong>：<ul>\n<li>1.21 - 1.21.4：安装<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flegendary-tooltips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传奇提示</a></li>\n<li>1.21.10+：请确保使用基础武器模组<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbasicweapons%252fversion%252fQxrGeMMG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">2.2.2+1.21.10</a>或更高版本，该版本包含针对任何接受锋利或威能附魔的武器的修复。</li></ul></li>\n</ul><hr><strong>六种</strong><br><em>如果安装了更好的战斗模组，武器还会根据命中的敌人数量和连击效果进行平衡。</em><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e7436b268b5c88d9db1a927204bc166452130e01.png\" alt=\"各种基础武器\"><em>独特、强大、易于使用</em><em>公平。</em><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>武器</th>\n<th>伤害</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>基础效果</th>\n<th>攻击距离</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>原版剑</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>横扫</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原版斧</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>慢速</td>\n<td>破盾</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匕首</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>快速</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>棍棒</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>慢速</td>\n<td>减速目标</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锤子</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极慢</td>\n<td>将目标击飞向上</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长矛</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法杖</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>横扫</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长柄刀</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极慢</td>\n<td>横扫</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h1>材质包系统</h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.khazoda.com%252fbasicweapons%252fmaterialpacks%252flist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">公开材质包列表</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.khazoda.com%252fbasicweapons%252fmaterialpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">材质包创建器</a><strong>basicweapons_materialpacks</strong><strong>请将它们视为模组文件，而非资源包或数据包。</strong><h1>模组集成</h1><h2>青铜</h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbronze\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">青铜</a><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d44bac5d553666b2d6cf517f9f6acda108f3165e.png\" alt=\"青铜基础武器\"><h2>更好的战斗</h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的战斗</a><h2>社区模组</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbonded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bonded</a>及其\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbonded-basic-weapons-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">兼容模块</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkevs-equipment-sets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kev的装备套装</a></li>\n</ul><strong>如果您有包含基础武器模组的项目，请告诉我！我喜欢看到大家的创作，如果愿意，我可以将您的项目添加到此列表中。</strong><h1>常见问题解答</h1><strong>“威能”附魔有什么作用？</strong><strong>是否有（fabric/forge/neoforge/risugami's modloader）版本？</strong><strong>您能否将模组向后移植到Minecraft 1.X.X版本？</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.khazoda.com%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">主要版本</a><strong>我发现了漏洞 / 我的游戏崩溃了</strong>",
